sequenceDiagram
    participant H as Human
    participant Git as Git 系统
    participant EG as DiOS Event Gateway
    participant M as 主控 Agent
    participant B as 开发 Agent
    participant A as 评审 Agent

    H->>Git: 创建 Issue
    Git->>EG: webhook issue.created
    EG->>M: 路由事件
    M->>B: 分派开发任务
    B->>Git: commit / push，创建 PR
    Git->>EG: webhook pr.created
    EG->>A: 路由事件
    A->>Git: 提交 Review
    Git->>EG: webhook review.submitted
    EG->>B: 路由事件
    Note over A,B: 循环修改直至通过
    A->>Git: Approve & Merge
    Git->>H: 通知完成
